WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.131
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.131 --> 00:00:04.000
TOM MORELLO: I didn't
trust teachers.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.420
I didn't trust politicians.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:09.460
I didn't trust people
on the evening news.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.800
I trusted music.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.340
The language of my life is
written in rock and roll,

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:18.180
and punk rock, and hip-hop.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.690
[SOUND EFFECTS]

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:25.380
I'd like to teach a class
that makes your guitar playing

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.000
meaningful to you.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.990
I'll show you ideas
in chords and solos.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.780
I'm going to go through my
entire arsenal of guitars,

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.380
amps, and effects pedals.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.400
You practice technique
to get your fingers

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.890
to go where you want them to go.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:44.250
You practice theory to
understand where they can go

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.060
and why.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.490
Rock and roll is a
visceral experience

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:49.170
and a connection with
the audience that

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:50.550
should be exciting at its core.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:50.800
[MUSIC - RAGE AGAINST THE
 MACHINE, "KILLING IN THE NAME"]

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.591
(SINGING) And now you
do what they told ya.

00:00:52.591 --> 00:00:54.672
Those who die are justified.

00:00:54.672 --> 00:00:57.576
For wearing the badge,
they're the chosen whites.

00:00:57.576 --> 00:01:00.480
They're justified,
those who died.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.805
For wearing the badge--

00:01:01.805 --> 00:01:04.379
I was the only black
kid in an all-white town

00:01:04.379 --> 00:01:07.560
and the only heavy metal
musician at Harvard University.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:11.070
In a world that can be cruel,
and is sometimes racist,

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.800
and is grossly unfair,
all of a sudden--

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.002
[PLAYS GUITAR]

00:01:17.002 --> 00:01:20.100
--with this thing
on, I'm invincible.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.720
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.930
In this class, you will
be able to write a song

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.850
and play a guitar solo.

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:31.995
Then we rock, even if you've
never touched a guitar before.

00:01:31.995 --> 00:01:34.990
And for the advanced
player, the sky's the limit.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.550
If you want to play
exactly like me,

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:38.830
you're going to figure that
out in this MasterClass.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:43.230
If you want to play
guitar exactly like you,

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:49.198
I'll reveal how you can create
a lifetime of awesome rocking.

00:01:49.198 --> 00:01:52.950
[PLAYING GUITAR]

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.300
I'm Tom Morello.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.790
And this is my MasterClass.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.640
[FEEDBACK]

